# RDS Desktop — OAuth (ECA) build config template. Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored) and fill in.
#
# The External Client App consumer key is a PUBLIC client id — this is a public
# PKCE client with NO secret (per the Session-26 leak scar, a secret is never
# created, stored, or committed). The key is baked into the build via electron-vite
# env inlining and can be overridden per-connection in the app's Settings.
#
# Source ECA: "RDS Desktop" (RDS_Desktop) in ldseed. See desktop/docs/OAUTH_APP_RUNBOOK.md.
# The MAIN_VITE_ prefix exposes it to the main process (where the A4 PKCE flow runs).
MAIN_VITE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=
